IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations (Cap. 323, Rg 6), 2004 Revised Edition: the rest of regulation 2 (definitions).
-- The definitions of "dealer" and "telecommunication equipment" are in sgta-i-rg6-dealers.l4, beside the rules that use them.
-- Text: subjects/sg/telecommunications-dealers-regulations-2003/registers/source-bundle/TA1999-RG6.txt.

§ `Rg 6 regulation 2: the other definitions`

-- src:TA1999-RG6:75 | 2. In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires —
-- src:TA1999-RG6:76 | "authorised officer" means any person authorised by the Authority to act on its
-- src:TA1999-RG6:77 | behalf;
@ref Rg 6 reg 2 opening words and "authorised officer" (src:TA1999-RG6:75-77)
GIVEN `the person is authorised by the Authority to act on its behalf` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: the person is an "authorised officer"` MEANS
    `the person is authorised by the Authority to act on its behalf`

-- src:TA1999-RG6:82 | "Dealer’s Class Licence" means a licence referred to in regulation 3;
-- src:TA1999-RG6:83 | "Dealer’s Individual Licence" means a licence referred to in regulation 4;
@ref Rg 6 reg 2 "Dealer's Class Licence" and "Dealer's Individual Licence" (src:TA1999-RG6:82-83)
GIVEN `it is a licence referred to in regulation 3` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is a "Dealer's Class Licence"` MEANS
    `it is a licence referred to in regulation 3`

GIVEN `it is a licence referred to in regulation 4` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is a "Dealer's Individual Licence"` MEANS
    `it is a licence referred to in regulation 4`

-- src:TA1999-RG6:84 | "identity card" means an identity card issued under the National Registration Act
-- src:TA1999-RG6:85 | (Cap. 201);
-- src:TA1999-RG6:86 | "licence" means a Dealer’s Class Licence or a Dealer’s Individual Licence;
-- src:TA1999-RG6:87 | "licensee" means a person to whom a licence is granted, and includes an
-- src:TA1999-RG6:88 | employee of the licensee;
@ref Rg 6 reg 2 "identity card", "licence" and "licensee" (src:TA1999-RG6:84-88)
GIVEN `it is an identity card issued under the National Registration Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is an "identity card"` MEANS
    `it is an identity card issued under the National Registration Act`

GIVEN `it is a Dealer's Class Licence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a Dealer's Individual Licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is a "licence"` MEANS
    `it is a Dealer's Class Licence` OR `it is a Dealer's Individual Licence`

GIVEN `a licence is granted to the person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an employee of a person to whom a licence is granted` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: the person is a "licensee"` MEANS
    `a licence is granted to the person` OR `the person is an employee of a person to whom a licence is granted`

-- src:TA1999-RG6:89 | "registered equipment" means any telecommunication equipment registered for
-- src:TA1999-RG6:90 | sale under regulation 21 (1);
-- src:TA1999-RG6:91 | "sale" includes every transaction of or in the nature of barter or exchange, every
-- src:TA1999-RG6:92 | transaction of hire or hire-purchase and every transaction by which any
-- src:TA1999-RG6:93 | goods are pawned or hypothecated or as the result of which the ownership
-- src:TA1999-RG6:94 | of or an interest in goods is or may be transferred or created;
@ref Rg 6 reg 2 "registered equipment" and "sale" (src:TA1999-RG6:89-94)
GIVEN `it is telecommunication equipment registered for sale under regulation 21(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is "registered equipment"` MEANS
    `it is telecommunication equipment registered for sale under regulation 21(1)`

GIVEN `it is a transaction of or in the nature of barter or exchange` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a transaction of hire or hire-purchase` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a transaction by which goods are pawned or hypothecated, or as a result of which the ownership of or an interest in goods is or may be transferred or created` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a sale in the ordinary sense` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is a "sale"` MEANS
    `it is a sale in the ordinary sense` OR `it is a transaction of or in the nature of barter or exchange` OR `it is a transaction of hire or hire-purchase` OR `it is a transaction by which goods are pawned or hypothecated, or as a result of which the ownership of or an interest in goods is or may be transferred or created`

-- src:TA1999-RG6:97 | "type-approved equipment" means any telecommunication equipment approved
-- src:TA1999-RG6:98 | for sale under regulation 20 (1).
@ref Rg 6 reg 2 "type-approved equipment" (src:TA1999-RG6:97-98)
GIVEN `it is telecommunication equipment approved for sale under regulation 20(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 2: this is "type-approved equipment"` MEANS
    `it is telecommunication equipment approved for sale under regulation 20(1)`
